model g14_nominal_row
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T, tally 2.1.6 (#89, P38, the third review's H2): an int input's row written as a compounding code past 64 bits is refused LOAD-UNIT, its type before its size; its twin is nominal_row_twin.tally."

source plan "T's fixture (invented values)"

input x: int

version v
  cite plan
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  x = nominal 100000000000000000000 "a compounding code where an int goes"

ask r1: x
